Z||000000||Uaana||06-11-2000||07:20 PM||||It was a warm sunny day. Bird were singing, children were playing in their yard.<BR>I had just left work and was enjoying the weather while stopped at a light when Johnny Trailerpark pulled alongside. I could tell right away I was in trouble, It was all there the black replacement fenders, festooned with every go fast sticker known to man. He even had the ultra Hi-po PIAA fog lights mounted under the front bumper. Well Johnny started revving, and the birds stopped singing, the childred stopped in their tracks to look at the 300H.P. monster trying to terrorize me and my little 87. Well I looked over, we made eye contact, nodded and waited for the light......<BR>Green!! with a resounding CHIRP Johnny Trailerpark nailed it, I pressed down on the skinny one and.....<BR>That was the last I ever saw of Johnny Trailerpark.<BR>Yall be careful out there if you ever find yourself in the suburbs of southern MN. Or you may just have to defend yourself from the 300H.P. Chevy Celebrity.||||reg||6
